 90 │ 	 * has already finished. Nothing in the design fixes a value, and this is the honest
 91 │ 	 * reading of what the operation costs rather than a policy.
 92 │ 	 */
 93 │ 	private static final String RETRY_AFTER_SECONDS = "1";
